   "title": "Longcase clock, walnut, London, about 1720",
   "category": "longcase",
   "image": "longcase.jpg",
   "excerpt": "8-day, brass dial with date. 218 cm. 18,500 zł.",
   "date": "2026-09-12",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-dial\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-dial\">Available</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">Came to us from a house in Zgierz with a cracked seatboard and one weight missing. New seatboard in oak, a replacement weight cast to match, full strip-down, twelve bushes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td>Maker</td><td>Unsigned, London</td></tr><tr><td>Case</td><td>Burr walnut veneer on oak</td></tr><tr><td>Height</td><td>218 cm</td></tr><tr><td>Movement</td><td>8-day, anchor escapement, strikes the hours on a bell</td></tr><tr><td>Price</td><td>18,500 zł, delivered and set up within 100 km</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"x-small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-x-small-font-size\">12 months warranty on every overhaul, 6 months on quartz movements.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
  },
  {
   "title": "Carriage clock, France, about 1890",
   "category": "mantel-and-carriage",
   "image": "carriage.jpg",
   "excerpt": "Brass case, enamel dial, 8-day. 3,200 zł.",
   "date": "2026-08-30",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-dial\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-dial\">Reserved</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">A plain one, which is why it is affordable. Keeps time to about a minute a week.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td>Case</td><td>Brass, bevelled glass on five sides</td></tr><tr><td>Height</td><td>16 cm with handle up</td></tr><tr><td>Movement</td><td>8-day, platform lever escapement</td></tr><tr><td>Price</td><td>3,200 zł</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"x-small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-x-small-font-size\">12 months warranty on every overhaul, 6 months on quartz movements.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
  },
  {
   "title": "Gold pocket watch, Switzerland, about 1880",
   "category": "watches",
   "image": "pocket.jpg",
   "excerpt": "Open face, key-wound. 4,800 zł.",
   "date": "2026-08-14",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-dial\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-dial\">Available</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">Serviced, new mainspring and a new crystal. The key is original.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td>Case</td><td>14 ct gold, open face, hinged dust cover</td></tr><tr><td>Movement</td><td>Key-wound cylinder movement</td></tr><tr><td>Size</td><td>42 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Price</td><td>4,800 zł, key included</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"x-small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-x-small-font-size\">12 months warranty on every overhaul, 6 months on quartz movements.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
  },
  {
   "title": "Mantel clock with Orpheus, Paris, about 1810",
   "category": "mantel-and-carriage",
   "image": "mantel.jpg",
   "excerpt": "Gilt bronze, dial signed Le Roy. Sold.",
   "date": "2026-07-22",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-dial-sold\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-dial-sold\">Sold</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">Sold to a collector in Poznań in July. We have a second, smaller one coming in the autumn.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td>Case</td><td>Gilt bronze figure of Orpheus with a lyre</td></tr><tr><td>Dial</td><td>White enamel, signed Le Roy, Paris</td></tr><tr><td>Movement</td><td>8-day, silk suspension converted to spring</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"x-small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-x-small-font-size\">12 months warranty on every overhaul, 6 months on quartz movements.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
  },
  {
   "title": "Urn clock with rotating hours, France, about 1790",
   "category": "from-the-bench",
   "image": "workshop.jpg",
   "excerpt": "Serviced for a private collector. Not for sale.",
   "date": "2026-06-30",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-dial\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-dial\">Not for sale</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">The owner lives in Warsaw and drove it down on the back seat of a Škoda wrapped in a duvet. It survived.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td>Type</td><td>Rotating-band clock: the hours turn past a fixed pointer</td></tr><tr><td>Work</td><td>Strip-down, two new pivots, band re-tensioned</td></tr><tr><td>Time on the bench</td><td>3 weeks</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"x-small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-x-small-font-size\">12 months warranty on every overhaul, 6 months on quartz movements.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
  },
  {
   "title": "Steel dress watch, serviced",
   "category": "watches",
   "image": "wristwatch.jpg",
