  {
   "title": "An automatic, open on the bench",
   "category": "from-the-bench",
   "image": "movement.jpg",
   "excerpt": "What a full service of an automatic watch involves, in order.",
   "date": "2026-05-10",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-dial\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-dial\">Not for sale</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">Taken apart, every part cleaned in three baths, the mainspring checked, jewels oiled with four different oils, reassembled, then timed in six positions over five days.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td>Parts</td><td>About 130 in an automatic with date</td></tr><tr><td>Time</td><td>Five to six hours of bench work, spread over a week</td></tr><tr><td>Price</td><td>from 550 zł</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"x-small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-x-small-font-size\">12 months warranty on every overhaul, 6 months on quartz movements.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
